6. Example CI/CD Pipeline with GitHub

Example using GitHub Actions:

1. Developer pushes code
2. GitHub Actions workflow triggers
3. Code builds automatically
4. Tests run
5. Docker image created
6. Image pushed to container registry
7. Application deployed to cloud server
7. CI/CD in Cloud Environments

Cloud platforms provide built-in CI/CD services:

AWS

AWS CodePipeline

AWS CodeBuild

AWS CodeDeploy

Azure

Azure DevOps

Google Cloud

Google Cloud Build

8. Real-World CI/CD Example

Suppose a team is building a web application.

Workflow:

Developer writes code locally.

Push to GitHub.

CI tool runs:

Build

Test

Docker image created using Docker.

Image deployed to cluster managed by Kubernetes.

Users access the updated application.

9. Advantages of CI/CD

✔ Faster releases
✔ Reduced human error
✔ Automated testing
✔ Improved software quality
✔ Faster bug detection

